# Stale boot image: the port's framework.jar has 7 dex files, this image was built for 6 ("expected 6 uncompressed dex
# files, but found 7"). ART rejected it every boot and zygote recompiled the whole boot classpath in RAM (29 s),
# and every /system odex built against it was rejected too. Without it odrefresh builds a valid image once on /data.
